    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/4f52086344b452913f2d77a43134781d.poster.avif?t=1751412709\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/4f52086344b452913f2d77a43134781d.webm?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/4f52086344b452913f2d77a43134781d.mp4?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a resilient base, strategically defend against relentless hostiles, harness vital resources. Don't forget to unlock technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a world transformed by a creeping corruption. In Surface Tension, you'll face the challenge of rebuilding and defending a fragile ecosystem against relentless hostile forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/e423db60b8832f8bedec286c9f55d658.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and manage a diverse range of resources. Whether through manual collection or automated buildings, you'll need to strategically acquire materials to fuel your technological progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building and Defense:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/fc12ff1f2fa7975a83b9004d0498f90e.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your base layout with precision. Every decision matters. A compact and well-defended base is crucial for survival. Be mindful of your energy levels, as they are the lifeblood of your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/10e6779cf6f58b4f47d2f7f80eb5dc67.poster.avif?t=1751412709\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/10e6779cf6f58b4f47d2f7f80eb5dc67.webm?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/10e6779cf6f58b4f47d2f7f80eb5dc67.mp4?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a vast tech tree. Discover and develop advanced technologies that empower you to construct sophisticated buildings, enhance your defenses, and combat the growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense tower defense combat. Defend your base against waves of diverse enemies. Adapt your strategies to counter their unique abilities and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/6a3d7b9eb278a3c35368693ee5075949.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span>Destroy enemy spawners to reclaim corrupted territories. Unravel the mysteries behind the hostile forces and their origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunker Development and Permanent Progression:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/bbe34333fdc39d2289b2cabe2dada32b.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a fortified bunker using resources salvaged from your enemies. These underground structures provide permanent bonuses, strengthening your defenses and enhancing your capabilities on the surface.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/4f52086344b452913f2d77a43134781d.poster.avif?t=1751412709\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/4f52086344b452913f2d77a43134781d.webm?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/4f52086344b452913f2d77a43134781d.mp4?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a resilient base, strategically defend against relentless hostiles, harness vital resources. Don't forget to unlock technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a world transformed by a creeping corruption. In Surface Tension, you'll face the challenge of rebuilding and defending a fragile ecosystem against relentless hostile forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/e423db60b8832f8bedec286c9f55d658.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and manage a diverse range of resources. Whether through manual collection or automated buildings, you'll need to strategically acquire materials to fuel your technological progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building and Defense:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/fc12ff1f2fa7975a83b9004d0498f90e.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your base layout with precision. Every decision matters. A compact and well-defended base is crucial for survival. Be mindful of your energy levels, as they are the lifeblood of your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/10e6779cf6f58b4f47d2f7f80eb5dc67.poster.avif?t=1751412709\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/10e6779cf6f58b4f47d2f7f80eb5dc67.webm?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/10e6779cf6f58b4f47d2f7f80eb5dc67.mp4?t=1751412709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a vast tech tree. Discover and develop advanced technologies that empower you to construct sophisticated buildings, enhance your defenses, and combat the growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense tower defense combat. Defend your base against waves of diverse enemies. Adapt your strategies to counter their unique abilities and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/6a3d7b9eb278a3c35368693ee5075949.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span>Destroy enemy spawners to reclaim corrupted territories. Unravel the mysteries behind the hostile forces and their origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunker Development and Permanent Progression:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609890/extras/bbe34333fdc39d2289b2cabe2dada32b.avif?t=1751412709\" data-has-big width=800 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a fortified bunker using resources salvaged from your enemies. These underground structures provide permanent bonuses, strengthening your defenses and enhancing your capabilities on the surface.</p>",
    "short_description": "Construct a base, harness resources, defend against relentless waves of hostiles. Don't forget to choose which technologies to research to combat a spreading corruption and restore nature in this roguelike base defense. But be quick the last wave is something else entirely.",
